    "detailed_description": "Meteor Volleyball! is a simple, fun, comic-like volleyball game that simulates your life if there were a meteor heading towards Earth and you have to survive by piloting a volleyball robot. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1816080/extras/b9e613dec1d66644a456babdb92bb4cc.poster.avif?t=1644917189\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1816080/extras/b9e613dec1d66644a456babdb92bb4cc.webm?t=1644917189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1816080/extras/b9e613dec1d66644a456babdb92bb4cc.mp4?t=1644917189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><br></li><li>Comic-like cut scene and fun dialogue.<br></li><li>2D platform volleyball game.<br></li><li>Very simple control.<br></li><li>Various Special Skills.</li></ul><br><strong>Story</strong><br>The earth is in danger of being destroyed by a huge meteorite!<br><br>Thanks to a genius Doctor, we can deflect meteorites! <br><br>But then...<br><br>Oh my gosh! This time, countless meteorites are falling!<br><br>If a meteor lands, your house will be destroyed!<br><br>Pilot the robot to protect our house!",
